\newlabel{fig:rrxorcomp}{{4}{5}{\textbf {RRXOR: ground truth, supervised, and unsupervised.} Left: ground-truth $36$ belief states (PC1/PC3 plane, display only). Centre: supervised decode (per-position $R^2=0.91$). Right: recovered subspace (per-position $R^2=0.65$, state-level $R^2=0.82$). The gap reflects weak observability}{figure.caption.6}{}}
